  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.24 Office of the executive director",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.24 “Office of the executive director” means the legal authority conferred by law on the executive director as implemented by OPLC staff who are not assigned to the division of licensing and board administration or the division of enforcement.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
